---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Legal Notice: Publisher of the German Care Calculators" description="Legal notice under section 5 DDG and section 18 MStV: who publishes the calculators for care grades, care allowance, respite care and care home costs, and who hosts them." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice (Impressum)</h1>
    <p>Information required by section 5 of the German Digital Services Act (DDG) for {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>Responsible for content (section 18(2) MStV)</h2>
    <p>{AUTHOR_NAME}, address as above, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>What this site does</h2>
    <p>It estimates the German care grade using the assessment instrument of section 15 of Book XI of the Social Code, calculates 2026 long-term care insurance benefits and shows average care home co-payments for each federal state as published by the vdek, the association of substitute health funds. It is not run by a Pflegekasse, the Medical Service or a care home, it is not care counselling under section 7a SGB XI and it provides no legal services. Only the competent Pflegekasse decides on a care grade. Methods: <a href={route('method', lang)}>how we calculate</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>Figures are re-checked after every change in the law and every new vdek release and are tested automatically before publication; we nonetheless give no guarantee that they are free of errors. Linked third-party sites are the responsibility of their operators. Please report mistakes via the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2>
    <p>The care allowance and care home calculators may be embedded free of charge by iframe as long as the source link stays visible: <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed a calculator</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Consumer dispute resolution</h2>
    <p>We are neither willing nor obliged to take part in proceedings before a consumer arbitration board. Data protection: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a>. Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
